1
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,760
I'm telling the truth.

2
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,090
Just trust me this once.

3
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:57,160
Mr. Wang,

4
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,480
are you asleep?

5
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,170
Go. I'll think about it.

6
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,000
Coming.

7
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,960
Do you have a guest?

8
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,320
I heard you talking to someone just now.

9
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:15,120
I had my phone on speaker.

10
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,760
God, it's so cold in here.

11
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,960
Why is your window open?

12
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,000
Close it quickly.

13
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:23,280
The heating is too strong. I'm getting some fresh air.

14
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,960
You'll catch a cold.

15
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,440
Did you come to see me so late

16
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,370
just to say this?

17
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,200
No, no.

18
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:30,800
I came to tell you,

19
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,600
maybe we should move out.

20
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:34,530
Didn't you want to move out before?

21
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:37,680
Besides, this hotel is not safe with people coming and going.

22
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,360
My family has a house over there.

23
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,560
It's empty anyway.

24
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,800
It'll be quiet if we go there.

25
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,800
What do you think?

26
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,560
Is it really convenient?

27
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:47,289
What's inconvenient about it?

28
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,600
It's my family's house.

29
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,660
No one lives there.

30
00:01:50,080 --> 00:01:50,720
Then

31
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:52,380
we'll leave tomorrow at noon.

32
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:54,840
Okay. It's up to you.

33
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:56,000
Okay.

34
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,120
Go to sleep early.

35
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:58,920
By the way,

36
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,360
when did you get here?

37
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,400
I just arrived. Why?

38
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,720
Nothing. Good night.

39
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,020
Good night.

40
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,280
Mr. Wang.

41
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,160
Mr. Wang.

42
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,960
Mr. Lin.

43
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,280
Are you okay?

44
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,290
Why are you here so late?

45
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,079
Come in.

46
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:58,820
No, thanks.

47
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,640
Glad you're okay.

48
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:02,040
I just wanted to tell you

49
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:04,680
there's news about the Korean pine you asked me to find.

50
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,480
That fast?

51
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,680
Xinchun isn't too big,

52
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,600
nor too small.

53
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:11,240
If you put your mind to it, you can find anything.

54
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,400
Thanks for your hard work, Mr. Lin.

55
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,330
You're welcome.

56
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:16,720
The materials aren't in my warehouse right now,

57
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,050
so it'll take some time.

58
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,520
I just wanted to let you know

59
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,780
so you wouldn't worry.

60
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,600
I could have just visited you tomorrow during the day.

61
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:25,600
Why make a trip here so late at night?

62
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:31,760
Sorry.

63
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,040
Mr. Lin,

64
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,880
about your cough,

65
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,980
how were the results from your last hospital visit?

66
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,079
It's nothing.

67
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,200
Just an old problem.

68
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,460
My trachea isn't good.

69
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,880
When I was young,

70
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:46,450
I always went into the forest to find wood.

71
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:49,360
It's a lingering illness from overworking.

72
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,160
It's nothing.

73
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,560
You must take care of your health.

74
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,890
As for our cooperation,

75
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:55,800
we still have a long way to go.

76
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,640
Yes, we do.

77
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,920
Get some rest early.

78
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:02,890
I'm leaving.

79
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:04,480
Wait.

80
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:08,760
I just took a look around.

81
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,320
The conditions in this hotel are a bit basic.

82
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:11,920
Oh, right.

83
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,280
I have a newly renovated house in the west of the city.

84
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,600
I'll have Dajun come over tomorrow to pack your luggage,

85
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:16,040
and you can move there.

86
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,040
No need, Mr. Lin.

87
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:22,960
Don't overthink it.

88
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,490
I don't mean anything else.

89
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,440
I'm just worried it's not safe here, you know?

90
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,300
There was a murder here recently.

91
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,080
I just feel that

92
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,600
for you to be alone

93
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,159
out here

94
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,770
for so many years hasn't been easy.

95
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,480
Get some rest.

96
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,160
Sir.

97
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:05,900
What are you doing?

98
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:10,370
Gathering some firewood to heat the kang.

99
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:11,850
That's good.

100
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,040
Who are you?

101
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,400
We want to ask you about someone.

102
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:22,600
Who is he?

103
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:23,920
Liu Ming.

104
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,810
I don't know him.

105
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,100
Never seen him.

106
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:28,930
I don't know him.

107
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:32,800
Sir.

108
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,960
Let me ask you something.

109
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:39,520
Do you think there's still anyone on this mountain

110
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,370
secretly taking wood home?

111
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,800
Stealing wood is a wicked thing to do.

112
00:05:46,159 --> 00:05:46,440
Yes.

113
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:48,040
They will face retribution.

114
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:51,120
They say money makes the mare go.

115
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:55,880
Can anyone resist the temptation of such profits?

116
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,000
If people are bold enough,

117
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,520
they'll do anything.

118
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,400
They say a dozen years ago,

119
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,520
there was a couple

120
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,440
who helped smuggle timber

121
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:07,380
down the mountain.

122
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,120
They were almost blown up.

123
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,040
This matter is complicated.

124
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,100
Very complicated.

125
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,040
Blown up?

126
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,840
Really? How come I've never heard of it?

127
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,400
Where would you hear it?

128
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,760
No one wants trouble.

129
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:20,600
It snowed heavily for three days.

130
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,080
All traces were gone.

131
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:23,120
Sir.

132
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:26,330
Are people still stealing timber now?

133
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,960
During the day,

134
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,840
this forest

135
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:30,920
is full of people.

136
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,690
There are people cutting wood,

137
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,240
measuring,

138
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,640
and driving.

139
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,600
But at night,

140
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,720
when the moon comes up,

141
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:42,600
come back and take a look.

142
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,320
Some things

143
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,000
can't be seen during the day.

144
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:55,040
Come a bit later.

145
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,159
Listen for the sounds,

146
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,440
and you'll know.

147
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,240
Okay, sir.

148
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:03,680
We'll leave you to it.

149
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,120
Okay.

150
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,040
Goodbye.

151
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:15,760
Xin F 98630.

152
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:16,720
They've been saying they'll tear it down,

153
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:17,780
but they never did.

154
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,080
Fewer people live here now,

155
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:20,940
but it's quiet.

156
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,000
Mr. Wang.

157
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,560
You can stay in this room.

158
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,720
It's big and faces south.

159
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,720
I'll just stay across from you.

160
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,960
This is your home, after all.

161
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:21,360
I'll take the small room.

162
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,980
Don't fight me on this.

163
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,320
Make yourselves at home.

164
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:27,320
You can put your luggage away first.

165
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:58,840
Miss Li.

166
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,610
Is this your mother?

167
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,240
I've almost forgotten what she looks like.

168
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,960
My dad said she ran off with someone.

169
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,280
So everything related to her in the house

170
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,400
was locked up,

171
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,730
except for this wedding photo.

172
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,920
But sometimes I feel

173
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,770
like she never left.

174
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,520
And sometimes I feel

175
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:27,020
like she just didn't want me anymore.

176
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,000
By the way.

177
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,400
Do you remember that day in the woods

178
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:33,460
when we ran in different directions?

179
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,480
I met a very strange person

180
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:37,440
who turned and ran as soon as she saw me.

181
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,560
After I chased her

182
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,120
to see who she was,

183
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:42,380
I was knocked out from behind with a club.

184
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,320
I think...

185
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,040
You think...

186
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:49,340
Never mind.

187
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,210
Let's get to work first.

188
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:06,720
Hello, Dad.

189
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,680
Sweetie, where are you?

190
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:10,200
Are you coming home for dinner today?

191
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,440
I'm at the old house.

192
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,720
What are you doing at the old house?

193
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:15,280
No one has lived there for so long.

194
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,680
It's dirty and run-down.

195
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,360
I'm here with Mr. Wang.

196
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:20,480
The hotel is not convenient.

197
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,200
Mr. Wang went there too?

198
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,000
You kid.

199
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,860
Why didn't you tell me in advance?

200
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,610
Is that place even livable?

201
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,800
Don't neglect Mr. Wang.

202
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,320
Okay, say no more.

203
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,520
I'll go over right now.

204
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,160
I'll help you clean up.

205
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:32,920
No need.

206
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:33,800
You...

207
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,680
Your dad is coming?

208
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,160
Yes.

209
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,570
He worries too much.

210
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,120
He cares about you.

211
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,660
Why did you take it off?

212
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,480
I'm so sorry about this.

213
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,240
Boss Li.

214
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:57,730
Xuefei, you're being so thoughtless.

215
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,570
How could you let him stay here?

216
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:01,480
This is no place for guests.

217
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,160
Mr. Wang, why don't you

218
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,200
move to my house?

219
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,050
No need, it's fine here.

220
00:11:06,160 --> 00:11:06,920
It's clean.

221
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:08,240
It's quite comfortable to stay in.

222
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:10,000
Sorry for the trouble, though.

223
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,280
No trouble at all.

224
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,880
Forgive our poor hospitality.

225
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:13,640
Not at all.

226
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:16,520
Come out for a second.

227
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:18,120
I have something to tell you.

228
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,650
What are you thinking, kid?

229
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:30,080
Are you stupid?

230
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,720
You're living with him.

231
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,880
What if something happens?

232
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,080
Keep your voice down.

233
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,440
What could happen between us?

234
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,040
What could possibly happen?

235
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:38,360
You're a grown woman,

236
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:41,240
living alone with a man.

237
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:41,920
If word gets out,

238
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,040
what will people say?

239
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,160
Let them say what they want.

240
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,620
I don't care what they say.

241
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:46,800
Do you still want to get married?

242
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:47,320
You...

243
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,680
Don't worry about me getting married.

244
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:49,800
Dad, how big do you think our house is?

245
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,930
He can hear everything you're saying.

246
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,520
Worrying for nothing.

247
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:58,720
Xuefei is right.

248
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:00,800
Mr. Wang is from the south.

249
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,600
Is the heating here warm enough?

250
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:05,160
It's quite warm. I even took off my coat.

251
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,490
Getting used to it here?

252
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:08,360
Well,

253
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:09,960
Mr. Wang,

254
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:12,400
if you have some free time these days,

255
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:13,280
about our factory...

256
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:13,840
Dad.

257
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,980
The Old Korean Pine matter is in the past.

258
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,920
Mr. Wang and I are partners now.

259
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:22,040
I plan to put the factory's affairs on hold

260
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:24,200
and help him finish Xinchun's business first.

261
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,080
Partners?

262
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,920
That's a good thing.

263
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:28,560
Why didn't you tell me beforehand?

264
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:29,400
I forgot.

265
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,480
Have you had any headaches lately?

266
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,160
I'll buy you some medicine

267
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:32,960
and bring it to you later.

268
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,220
Old problem. I'm fine.

269
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,360
Daughters are the best.

270
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,400
So caring.

271
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,400
Okay, a partnership is good.

272
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,640
Listen,

273
00:12:40,920 --> 00:12:42,680
in your future partnership,

274
00:12:42,680 --> 00:12:44,440
you should learn more from Mr. Wang.

275
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,480
If there's anything you don't understand,

276
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,340
you have to ask.

277
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,440
I know, I know.

278
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:49,800
If Xuefei does anything inadequate,

279
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,330
feel free to criticize her.

280
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,680
Well,

281
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,240
if you need anything, just tell Xuefei.

282
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,320
It's our own factory.

283
00:12:56,320 --> 00:12:58,360
We have the equipment and workers.

284
00:12:58,880 --> 00:12:59,760
Don't worry, Mr. Li.

285
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:00,890
Xuefei is very good.

286
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,040
By the way,

287
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:04,020
I prepared a lease agreement.

288
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:06,120
Let's sign it.

289
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,320
What agreement?

290
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:08,280
No need to sign.

291
00:13:08,360 --> 00:13:09,760
This house is empty anyway.

292
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:10,800
No, we have to sign it.

293
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:12,160
Otherwise, I'll feel bad.

294
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:13,320
I said no need.

295
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,160
Let's sign it. I'll go get it.

296
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,040
Wait a minute.

297
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,360
Look at this.

298
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,650
Why sign a contract?

299
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:19,720
It's fine to sign it.

300
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:21,320
No one owes anyone anything.

301
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,700
Business is business,

302
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:23,680
right?

303
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,760
Take a look.

304
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:27,960
Mr. Wang,

305
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,560
you wrote this a long time ago.

306
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,000
I knew you were coming,

307
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,130
so I just drafted it.

308
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,240
Okay, I got it.

309
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,640
Just pretend I signed it.

310
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:35,360
You'd better sign it.

311
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,880
Just sign it, Dad.

312
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:37,720
Don't make a fuss.

313
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:39,850
Otherwise, I won't feel at ease. Here.

314
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:40,640
Okay,

315
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,610
I'll listen to my daughter.

316
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:53,600
Done.

317
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:54,240
Okay.

318
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:57,040
What should I do?

319
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:57,960
Don't do anything.

320
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,160
Don't do anything, Dad.

321
00:13:59,160 --> 00:13:59,800
You...

322
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:00,480
Let me help.

323
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,520
You resting well is helping me.

324
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,720
The place is too small.

325
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,320
If you stand here, we can't even walk past.

326
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,650
Okay, I'm leaving then.

327
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,320
Mom.

328
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:12,920
Mom.

329
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:13,640
Mom.

330
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:16,560
Mom,

331
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,360
I finally found you.

332
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,760
Little girl,

333
00:14:20,760 --> 00:14:21,720
you must have the wrong person.

334
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:22,760
I'm not your mom.

335
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,800
What are you talking about, Mom?

336
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:25,720
I'm Xuefei.

337
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:26,920
Look at me.

338
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,480
I'm Xuefei.

339
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,200
I don't know you.

340
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,240
Child, you have the wrong person.

341
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,360
I'm not your mom.

342
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:44,920
Mom.

343
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,640
Where exactly are you?

344
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,600
I prepared a lease agreement.

345
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:04,260
Let's sign a lease agreement.

346
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,760
Who touched my painting?

347
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,160
Wait a minute.

348
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,980
This is the only way I can help you.

349
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,280
I'm a coward.

350
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:33,800
Mr. Wang's path is too narrow.

351
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:34,930
It's too dangerous.

352
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,580
We are not on the same path.

353
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:42,440
Uncle Cao.

354
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:45,440
How is the investigation of my family's case going?

355
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:48,000
We sent many people to look for that bald guy.

356
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,280
But we haven't seen him.

357
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:51,440
Uncle Cao.

358
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:52,960
You have to believe me.

359
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:54,120
He really is bald.

360
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:54,920
I saw him.

361
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:56,320
He is bald.

362
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,000
Soon.

363
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:29,160
Very soon.
